 ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/c6a17a1e7b3bb2bb72d8e1df4592e2e5.poster.avif?t=1748224839\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/c6a17a1e7b3bb2bb72d8e1df4592e2e5.webm?t=1748224839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/c6a17a1e7b3bb2bb72d8e1df4592e2e5.mp4?t=1748224839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bringing Together Extraction Looting and Survival Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a NAKWON citizen, you must maintain your shelter during the day and scavenge the city at night for resources. Choose how to spend your days and nights - your survival depends on it. Set up your shelter with furniture, scrap resources to craft items, and upgrade your gear. <br>Plan your expeditions carefully and scour the city ruins for anything that can keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/7deaaa9fa9d8b99c74333f989d0a00ec.poster.avif?t=1748224839\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/7deaaa9fa9d8b99c74333f989d0a00ec.webm?t=1748224839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/7deaaa9fa9d8b99c74333f989d0a00ec.mp4?t=1748224839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["NEXON"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.st